what are the deployment strategies that you are using in your pipelines ??
===========================================================================

coming to deployment strategies for critical applications we used blue green deployment where we can create 2 same environments with same configuration

blue and green 
in blue the current production application is avaliable 
in green environment the new version once after testing we will shift the traffic from blue env to green env by load balancer ---  cost is high

and for microservices deployments 
we used rolling update--- pods will gradually deployed when old pods are terminated one by one  --- zero downtime ---- 

canary deployment ---- used for eecommere application -- the new version will be tested within the few user if it good then we can increase the user percentage and use it.


